  "notable_quotes": [
    "The C2-hydrocarbon hysteresis in Zn2(Atz)2Ox is classified as a type H1 loop, consistent with adsorption in cylindrical-shape channels.",
    "The paper attributes adsorption hysteresis mainly to capillary condensation governed by adsorbate properties and pore size/shape.",
    "Compared with CO2, C2 hydrocarbons have slightly larger size and stronger binding affinity, leading to higher desorption resistance in Zn2(Atz)2Ox."
